 <h3><u>KUL NAZME QAAENAAT HAI ZAHRA KE HAATH MEI</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p><span grande,tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif; font-size:12.727272033691406px>SAYYEDA TAHERA ...... 10</span><br> <br> <span grande,tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif; font-size:12.727272033691406px>KUL NAZME QAAENAAT HAI ZAHRA KE HAATH ME 3</span><br> <br> <span grande,tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif; font-size:12.727272033691406px>SHERE KHUDA KA HAATH HAI ZAHRA KE HAATH ME</span><br> <br> <span grande,tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif; font-size:12.727272033691406px>1 ALLAH NE MANGAA LI SARE ARSH ROTIYA 2</span><br> <span grande,tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif; font-size:12.727272033691406px>KOI TOH AISI BAAT HAI ZAHRA KE HAATH ME</span><br> <br> <span grande,tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif; font-size:12.727272033691406px>2 JIS GHAR SE CHAL RAHA HAI ZAMAANE KA HAR NIZAAM 2</span><br> <span grande,tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif; font-size:12.727272033691406px>USKI MA AASHIYAT HAI ZAHRA KE HAATH MEI<br> <br> 3 BETI KO SAATH LAAYE HAI IS WAASTE RASOOL 2<br> NAJRANIYO KI MAAT HAI ZAHRA KE HAATH ME<br> <br> 4 MAALIK HAI JISE CHAHE YEH TABDEELIYA KARE 2<br> LAUHO KALAM DAWAAT HAI ZAHRA KE HAATH ME<br> <br> 5 KEHNE LAGE HUSSAIN YEH ROOMAAL BAANDH KAR 2<br> JAA HUR TERI NIJAAAT HAI ZAHRA KE HAATH ME<br> <br> 6 HAATHO ME HAATH SHABBARO SHABBIR KE NAHI 2<br> ISLAM KI HAYAAT HAI ZAHRA KE HAATH MEI<br> <br> 7 KAISE MITAAYE KOI AZAA KI NISHAANIYA 2<br> HIFZE TABARRUKAAT HAI ZAHRA KE HAATH ME<br> <br> 8 TASBIHE FATEMA NE TAKALLUM BATA DIYA 2<br> HAR RADDE MUSHKILAAT HAI ZAHRA KE HAATH MEI</span></p> 
